From: Anland packaging maintainers <packaging@anland.invalid>
Date: Thu, 14 Aug 2026 15:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] hyprgrass: use staged Hyprland internal header paths

Hyprgrass is built against the exact staged Hyprland source package. Hyprland
internal headers use both src-relative includes and generated protocol headers,
so expose those two directories when HYPRLAND_HEADERS is used instead of an
installed hyprland.pc dependency.

Forwarded: not-needed
---
Index: third_party/hyprgrass/meson.build
===================================================================
--- a/third_party/hyprgrass/meson.build
+++ b/third_party/hyprgrass/meson.build
@@ -25,6 +25,8 @@ if not hyprland_headers.found()
   endif
 
   add_global_arguments('-I' + hyprland_src, language: 'cpp')
+  add_global_arguments('-I' + join_paths(hyprland_src, 'src'), language: 'cpp')
+  add_global_arguments('-I' + join_paths(hyprland_src, 'protocols'), language: 'cpp')
 endif
 
 if get_option('hyprgrass')
@@ -45,4 +47,4 @@ hyprland_deps = [
 ]
 
 subdir('examples')
-subdir('src')
+subdir('src')
